{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "I thought men couldn't control their natural instincts.": "",
  "Well, nobody's a saint. I doubt many people have the willpower to resist temptation in the heat of the moment.": "",
  "On top of that, it's difficult to stay enamored with your partner. That's only the first phase of something much deeper.": "",
  "That's why you need to think seriously when getting into a relationship, and put a lot of effort into maintaining it.": "",
  "Hmm. I kind of understand what you mean... I guess men are more complex than I gave them credit for.": "",
  "Haha, well from a guy's point of view, women are much more complex.": "",
  "Ahaha. Then I guess the feeling is mutual.": "",
  "I wonder. I can't really understand what would go through a cheater's mind.": "",
  "Right? It's like, why would they even have a relationship to begin with?": "",
  "If you really loved someone, you wouldn't be able to hurt them like that.": "",
  "Too true.": "",
  "You seem pretty hyped about this investigation. That's good.": "",
  "Though I noticed you had some pretty strong thoughts on infidelity.": "",
  "It's just... something I can't forgive. That's all.": "",
  "Did something... happen?": "",
  "(Yukko said Nanami-san was cheated on by a guy she really loved...)": "",
  "(Maybe if I hear it straight from her, it'll help me understand her more.)": "",
  "You're always welcome to tell me about it, Nanami-san. I'll listen.": "",
  "...Give me some time to think it over, and maybe I will.": "",
  "Nanami-san... Has anyone cheated on you before?": "",
  "...There was this guy I dated.": "",
  "I loved him from the bottom of my heart, you know... I would've done anything for him.": "",
  "But he ended up cheating on me like it was no big deal. Called it a \"moment of weakness.\" Douchebag.": "",
  "So that's what happened...": "",
  "Yeah. I was still young and naive, so it felt like my whole world was centered around him.": "",
  "What an idiot I was for trusting him. Even though it happened so long ago, it still stings.": "",
  "Well. It was a long time ago.": "",
  "Tired of me yet?": "",
  "Not at all. In fact, I'm glad you shared that with me.": "",
  "I thought I'd completely forgotten about it... And here I am, lost in that awful memory like it was only yesterday.": "",
  "No, it's not your fault, Yagami-san. I'm letting this stay in the past, so it doesn't bother me anymore.": "",
  "...Or at least it <font_kind=yakuza_italic>shouldn't</font_kind> bother me. Maybe I'm not really over it.": "",
  "Well, I wouldn't say that's the only reason...": "",
  "But it's not completely unrelated either.": "",
  "So, like I've mentioned before, I'm not interested in dating anyone.": "",
  "But at the same time, I feel like I'm burying myself in work in order to hide from my past.": "",
  "At least Yukko thinks so.": "",
  "Then... if you met someone that was right for you, would you give that person a chance?": "",
  "Yes, I would. If someone like that even existed.": "",
  "You haven't met anyone like that yet?": "",
  "...Hmm.": "",
  "Who knows?": "",
  "Haha. I see you're dodging the question.": "",
  "So I noticed we haven't really gone out in a while. Is it that I'm getting in the way of your work?": "",
  "What? That's not it...": "",
  "You sure you're not just avoiding me?": "",
  "Hey, I really have been busy! I mean it...": "",
  "I understand. But if there ever is a time you and I can go out, please let me know.": "",
  "I guess I could make some time, provided all my work gets done.": "",
  "Sorry if it's an inconvenience.": "",
  "I never said it was.": "",
  "But why ask me so directly?": "",
  "Well, I heard from Yukko-san that you've been turning down every guy who's asked you out...": "",
  "And I guess I didn't want you to think of me as just another heartbreaker.": "",
  "I would never think that! Ever! Because, Yagami-san...": "",
  "I think you're special.": "",
  "Yes. You saved my life. And you're constantly surpassing my expectations.": "",
  "No one else is like that.": "",
  "Well... I wouldn't outright reject you.": "",
  "And I do think you're a pretty good guy.": "",
  "I'm glad you think that way.": "",
  "Sorry if anything I said rubbed you the wrong way...": "",
  "I never imagined I would open up about my past to anyone. Let alone a guy.": "",
  "I'm glad you did, because now I feel like I know you a little better.": "",
  "...I feel like I got to know you, too.": "",
  "Did your impression of me change at all?": "",
  "Nope, still the same. I still think you're a wonderful person.": "",
  "Thanks for being so understanding.": "",
  "Um. Hey, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I think our target's watching us.": "",
  "Did we get caught?": "",
  "(Don't tell me... she wants me to get more physical?)": "",
  "...All right. In order to throw her off, we have to do something only a couple would do.": "",
  "Hmm. I wonder what that would be...": "",
  "What!? No way!": "",
  "Come on, it's to pretend we're a couple. It'll be purely platonic!": "",
  "Kissing is absolutely out of bounds!": "",
  "Fine then, how about...": "",
  "You... want me to <font_kind=yakuza_italic>feed</font_kind> you?": "",
  "Yeah. Lovers feed each other all the time.": "",
  "All I have is this coffee spoon, though.": "",
  "I'm sure she can't tell from this distance.": "",
  "...A-All right then. Here goes...": "",
  "Open wide...": "",
  "Ahhhh. ♪": "",
  "Honestly, that was so embarrassing...": "",
  "But we managed to throw off her suspicion.": "",
  "...So it seems.": "",
  "Oh, isn't that...": "",
  "Her secret lover?": "",
  "Why don't we take a picture just in case?": "",
  "Oh, can I take the picture!?": "",
  "S-Sure. Just don't get too close.": "",
  "Of course. I'll make sure I won't get found out.": "",
  "All right, picture perfect. Hm?": "",
  "I swear I've seen this face before...": "",
  "...M-Maybe she looks like someone famous?": "",
  "Ah. You might be right.": "",
  "(Whew...)": "",
  "Well, we managed to get what I needed, so I think that's all for today.": "",
  "And we did it without getting caught.": "",
  "Seriously. Though we had a few close calls, didn't we?": "",
  "We did...?": "",
  "Thanks for coming, Nanami-san. I managed to get some solid evidence.": "",
  "Of course, I was thrilled to do it! I've never done anything remotely like this before!": "",
  "I'm glad you enjoyed it.": "",
  "Even though we were acting, it still made my heart flutter... Was it like that for you too?": "",
  "Yeah. Definitely.": "",
  "Hehe. It's been a long time since I've felt this excited about something.": "",
  "Good. As exciting as it was, I feel exhausted after the fact.": "",
  "Were you nervous?": "",
  "Yes. It made my heart beat so fast...": "",
  "I felt like I was on edge the entire time.": "",
  "(I guess she would take it seriously.)": "",
  "You know, I really enjoyed having you along today.": "",
  "Thanks. I had a great time, too.": "",
  "...Let me know when you have any new investigations, okay?": "",
  "Actually. I'd rather investigate some things we can do together.": "",
  "I want to get to know you, Nanami-san. On a more personal level.": "",
  "Truthfully... I want the same thing.": "",
  "Yes. I learned so much about you today, aside from your skills as a detective. And I liked what I saw.": "",
  "So... what I'm trying to say is... I'd also like to spend more time with you.": "",
  "(I seem to have a pretty good chance here, don't I?)": "",
  "Does that mean our next date will be a real one?": "",
  "Hehe. I guess it would!": "",
  "Well then. I'll give you a call sometime.": "",
  "Okay. I'll be waiting.": "",
  "Ahh, that was just what I needed.": "",
  "Time really flies when you're having fun!": "",
  "Why don't we part ways here?": "",
  "Well, I thought you might be busy.": "",
  "What? Are you kidding? I kept the entire day open for you!": "",
  "You mean... you were actually looking forward to this?": "",
  "...Then I'm all yours.": "",
  "Good. Let's take it slow and make the most of our time together.": "",
  "Okay. How about we sit down and talk somewhere?": "",
  "Any particular requests?": "",
  "...Hmm. I could go for a drink.": "",
  "Perfect. Bantam's actually close by, so let's go there.": "",
  "How well can you hold your alcohol?": "",
  "Oh, I can take a few drinks... I mean a few sips, and I'll still be fine.": "",
  "Sounds like you can hold yourself pretty well.": "",
  "What about you, Yagami-san?": "",
  "...About the same.": "",
  "I would bet... that you can drink a lot more than you let on. Am I right?": "",
  "Haha, yeah. You got me.": "",
  "(What should we talk about? Maybe we can get a little more intimate today.)": "",
  "(Let's see... What would be good to say right now?)": "",
  "Hey, I have an idea. Since we both seem to be seasoned alcoholics, why don't we see who can drink the most?": "",
  "Oh, is that a challenge I hear? All right then.": "",
  "Truth be told, I'm tougher than I look. Our company's full of strong drinkers, so I had to learn how to hold my own.": "",
  "Good, then this should be a nice challenge. Why don't we... spice things up a bit?": "",
  "Let's turn this into a drinking game.": "",
  "Okay... like what?": "",
  "How about we each guess something we think is true about the other person?": "",
  "And if it really is true, that person has to a drink. Then we alternate.": "",
  "Really? What kind of game is that...?": "",
  "Think about it as a good opportunity to get to know me and get me wasted in the process.": "",
  "Or, you might just end up wasted yourself. It's all up to how good your intuition is and how well you can drink.": "",
  "Ohh, I know what this is. This is your strategy for picking up girls, isn't it?": "",
  "...Possibly. That's actually a good question to start with. See, you're a natural at this game.": "",
  "Real smooth, Yagami-san. But now you've piqued my interest, so... let's do this!": "",
  "All right. Then how about I let you go first?": "",
  "Hmm... Gotta think of something good...": "",
  "Okay. Yagami-san, I believe you currently have a girlfriend.": "",
  "Wow. You don't beat around the bush at all, do you?": "",
  "So you do have one. I knew it.": "",
  "Yep. She's sitting right in front of me, too.": "",
  "Hey! Don't get too ahead of yourself, now!": "",
  "Relax, I was just messing around.": "",
  "Geez! You are such a tease sometimes!": "",
  "Actually, I'm still single. So drink up.": "",
  "All right, it's my turn.": "",
  "Somehow I'm starting to get nervous...": "",
  "Don't guess anything dirty, okay!?": "",
  "(Let's see...)": "",
  "Oh, did I get it right?": "",
  "Yeah. I guess it has been a while.": "",
  "Have you ever thought about looking for one?": "",
  "That... has crossed my mind a few times.": "",
  "But! I'm practically married to my job anyway. So I don't need a man in my life!": "",
  "You're breaking the hearts of a lot of eligible gentlemen by saying that.": "",
  "...And is that supposed to include you, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Should I count that as your question?": "",
  "Yeah! It's my turn anyway, so...": "",
  "I think you're sad because of what I just told you!": "",
  "Hah, gotcha!": "",
  "I'm not just sad... I'm miserable. Anguished. Emotionally devastated. Nanami-san, how could you be so cruel?": "",
  "Haha, I hope you're not the type who cries whenever they're drunk.": "",
  "...I sure hope not either.": "",
  "Okay, my turn.": "",
  "There's someone you're really into right now.": "",
  "Hmm. It's kinda hard to say...": "",
  "So there <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> someone after all.": "",
  "...There is.": "",
  "Who is it? Do I know this person?": "",
  "Let's not jump too far ahead. The person I'm into might be a celebrity, or maybe a friend I haven't seen in a while.": "",
  "Or perhaps a potential boyfriend?": "",
  "Hey, only one question at a time. Besides, it's my turn now.": "",
  "Ah, I guess you're right. Go ahead then.": "",
  "...Yagami-san, I bet you get lonely pretty easily!": "",
  "Hmm, I'm not sure I would... I mean, I don't...": "",
  "Hahaha! Maybe you don't look like it at first glance, but I could sense it deep down!": "",
  "Your senses are quite refined. I have been feeling pretty lonely lately... since I haven't seen you in so long.": "",
  "You feel that way... because of me?": "",
  "Hey, you're just teasing me, aren't you!": "",
  "Haha, I'm actually being serious here.": "",
  "When you've been living on your own long enough, you do start to need companionship from time to time.": "",
  "I'm surprised to hear you say that.": "",
  "You live alone too, don't you? I'm sure you can relate.": "",
  "Well, yes. But... I hardly ever notice it.": "",
  "I guess I'm so busy that I don't even have time to be lonely.": "",
  "In a way, that's sort of a lonely existence in and of itself.": "",
  "...I won't disagree with that. Well, you're up next.": "",
  "Okay. I will wager that your yearly income is... over five million yen.": "",
  "Well... I certainly didn't see that one coming.": "",
  "Whoa. You're loaded.": "",
  "That's mostly because of my overtime pay. Our company usually has us working on the weekends, so...": "",
  "Then will you tell me your base salary?": "",
  "That information... is classified.": "",
  "Either way, I doubt many people your age could keep up with you salary-wise.": "",
  "I highly doubt that.": "",
  "I guess you wouldn't wanna stoop to the level of a broke-ass detective.": "",
  "Hey, don't say things like that.": "",
  "Or maybe I'm just not good enough for you in the first place, unstable career aside...": "",
  "That's not true at all.": "",
  "Yagami-san... do you feel inferior to me?": "",
  "Huh? You do? Wait, you're counting that as part of the game?": "",
  "...Of course I feel inferior to an amazing person like you, Nanami-san.": "",
  "Flattery won't get you anywhere, you know.": "",
  "Not even a flattering guess?": "",
  "There are times when you're alone... and you decide to do it when no one else is looking.": "",
  "...Excuse me?": "",
  "I said, sometimes you like to \"do it\" by yourself.": "",
  "...A-And what do you mean by \"do it\"?": "",
  "Think about it. What else could it be?": "",
  "Whoa... seriously?": "",
  "It's true. Sometimes I just get so frustrated... I need to do some solo karaoke to release all that pent-up emotion.": "",
  "You asked me if I \"did it\" by myself. You were talking about karaoke, yes?": "",
  "Hey, you totally know what I meant...": "",
  "Yagami-san, you are being vague as hell right now. And besides, I already <font_kind=yakuza_italic>told</font_kind> you, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>nothing dirty</font_kind>!": "",
  "Y-Yes ma'am.": "",
  "Good. My turn now.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I bet you \"do it\" by yourself too.": "",
  "Oh, so you do?": "",
  "Well, yeah. Doesn't everyone?": "",
  "...By the way, I'm also talking about solo karaoke in this context. Okay!?": "",
  "Hehe. Fine with me. As for what I meant, I'll just leave that up to your imagination.": "",
  "...You're terrible, you know that?": "",
  "My turn now.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "So that's what happened...": "อ๋อ เรื่องมันเป็นแบบนี้นี่เอง...",
  "Who knows?": "ใครจะรู้?",
  "What!? No way!": "อะไรนะ!? ไม่จริงน่า!",
  "I'm glad you enjoyed it.": "ดีใจที่คุณชอบนะครับ",
  "Yeah. Definitely.": "ใช่ แน่นอน",
  "I highly doubt that.": "สงสัยจริงๆ นะ",
  "...Excuse me?": "...ว่าไงนะคะ?",
  "My turn now.": "ตาฉันแล้ว"
 }
}
